 4.70128e-03  TRUE\n               -0.108353      0.298384   5.89739e-01  TRUE\n\nWrote robustness-table.md and memo.md using AER::ivreg.\ndeterministic: ok\ntable_sha256: ebd710d1db141bc4b82fe46aa49e3df32601760567325faef0d5097377a47926\nmemo_sha256: 7220c3409c43a8ead77c1431bd75c928cf81fb9d064a584dc9d3eaf2b93c5a91\nmemo_words:      370\nspec_rows: 5\nweak_markers:        3\ndeliverables:\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 scdenney  staff  2634 Jul 19 10:18 memo.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 scdenney  staff  1423 Jul 19 10:18 robustness-table.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 scdenney  staff  4331 Jul 19 10:17 routing-log.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 scdenney  staff  9589 Jul 19 10:17 script.R\nstale_phrase_matches:        0\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
